ACADEMIC PROJECT

UniSaver Legacy is a sanitized portfolio snapshot of the author's 2023–2024 final year project at Northumbria University, titled:

"Developing an E-Commerce Website to Help University Students with Financial Difficulties in Newcastle"

Any rights or permissions arising under applicable Northumbria University regulations, intellectual property policies, academic agreements, or third-party collaboration arrangements remain unaffected. This notice does not claim ownership of intellectual property belonging to Northumbria University or other rights holders.

